l_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m002-0284","start":284,"end":286,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003478","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m002-0292","start":292,"end":296,"surface":"南陽守齮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003479","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p003","text":"項羽至，以沛公為漢王。漢王賜勃爵為威武侯。從入漢中，拜為將軍。還定三秦，至秦，賜食邑懷德。攻槐裏、好畤，最。擊趙賁、內史保於咸陽，最。北攻漆。擊章平、姚卬軍。西定汧。還下郿、頻陽。圍章邯廢丘。破西丞。擊盜巴軍，破之。攻上邽。東守峣關。轉擊項籍。攻曲逆，最。還守敖倉，追項籍。籍已死，因東定楚地泗（川）［水］、東海郡，凡得二十二縣。還守雒陽、櫟陽，賜與潁（陽）［陰］侯共食鐘離。以將軍從高帝反者燕王臧荼，破之易下。所將卒當馳道為多。賜爵列侯，剖符世世勿絕。食絳八千一百八十戶，號絳侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003478","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"內史保","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"章平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"姚卬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003482","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"西丞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"盜巴軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"籍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0175","start":175,"end":183,"surface":"潁（陽）［陰］侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003483","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0196","start":196,"end":200,"surface":"燕王臧荼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003484","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p004","text":"以將軍從高帝擊反韓王信於代，降下霍人。以前至武泉，擊胡騎，破之武泉北。轉攻韓信軍銅鞮，破之。還，降太原六城。擊韓信胡騎晉陽下，破之，下晉陽。後擊韓信軍於硰石，破之，追北八十里。還攻樓煩三城，因擊胡騎平城下，所將卒當馳道為多。勃遷為太尉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"韓王信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"胡騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"胡騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"胡騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m004-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p006","text":"燕王盧綰反，勃以相國代樊噲將，擊下薊，得綰大將抵、丞相偃、守陘、太尉弱、御史大夫施，屠渾都。破綰軍上蘭，復擊破綰軍沮陽。追至長城，定上谷十二縣，右北平十六縣，遼西、遼東二十九縣，漁陽二十二縣。最從高帝得相國一人，丞相二人，將軍、二千石各三人；別破軍二，下城三，定郡五，縣七十九，得丞相、大將各一人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"燕王盧綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003497","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"樊噲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003498","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003497","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"大將抵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003499","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"丞相偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003500","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"守陘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003501","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"太尉弱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003502","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0036","start":36,"end":41,"surface":"御史大夫施","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003503","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003497","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003497","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0101","start":101,"end":105,"surface":"相國一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0106","start":106,"end":110,"surface":"丞相二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0114","start":114,"end":117,"surface":"二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m006-0143","start":143,"end":148,"surface":"大將各一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p007","text":"勃為人木彊敦厚，高帝以為可屬大事。勃不好文學，每召諸生說士，東鄉坐而責之：「趣為我語。」其椎少文如此。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m007-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m007-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m007-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m007-0025","start":25,"end":29,"surface":"諸生說士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p008","text":"勃既定燕而歸，高祖已崩矣，以列侯事孝惠帝。孝惠帝六年，置太尉官，以勃為太尉。十歲，高后崩。呂祿以趙王為漢上將軍，呂產以呂王為漢相國，秉漢權，欲危劉氏。勃為太尉，不得入軍門。陳平為丞相，不得任事。於是勃與平謀，卒誅諸呂而立孝文皇帝。其語在呂后、孝文事中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003471","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003504","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003504","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003505","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"呂祿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003506","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"呂產","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003507","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"劉氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003508","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003468","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003508","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"諸呂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、假設侯嗣、職署或未定回指；不補姓名、親屬成員或爵位所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0110","start":110,"end":114,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003509","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003505","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m008-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003509","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p018","text":"竇太后曰：「皇后兄王信可侯也。」景帝讓曰：「始南皮、章武侯先帝不侯，及臣即位乃侯之。信未得封也。」竇太后曰：「人主各以時行耳。自竇長君在時，竟不得侯，死後乃［封］其子彭祖顧得侯。吾甚恨之。帝趣侯信也！」景帝曰：「請得與丞相議之。」丞相議之，亞夫曰：「高皇帝約『非劉氏不得王，非有功不得侯。不如約，天下共擊之』。今信雖皇后兄，無功，侯之，非約也。」景帝默然而止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003522","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"王信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003517","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"南皮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003525","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"章武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003526","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003522","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"竇長君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003527","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m018-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"彭祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003528","status":"c